    "title": "Mobile Residents Invited to Share Feedback on Police Department Through New Survey - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago The Mobile Police Department in Alabama has opened its CALEA Accreditation Public Comment Portal and Citizen Survey. This allows residents to provide feedback on the department’s performance and service.\nThe department has been accredited by the Commission on Accreditation for Law Enforcement Agencies (CALEA) since 1994. The survey and portal are part of the department’s efforts to gather public input and maintain its accreditation.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
